// Fabric, 4U: 500D to 1000D Cordura. Diffuse is the tiled OCP swatch, 1 repeat per 400 mm.
// Normal and specular weave tile 8 times per repeat, detail weave 16 times.
// Stage3: wear map (dust, scuffs, stains, tape, sharpie) on UV set 2 (tex1), unique to this size.
